<!-- Phase 38.1 — the notification small icon: the ">_" silhouette as a
     single-colour 24 dp vector (status-bar icons are tinted silhouettes;
     a full-colour adaptive foreground in that slot renders as a white
     box). Deliberately bolder than the launcher glyph (it fills the 24
     grid instead of the 66/108 safe zone) so it stays legible at status
     size. Used by RunForegroundService, TerminalForegroundService and
     CodecApiBridge's notify. -->
